        "data": {
          "comment": "# Ad Copy in Three Registers\n\nWrites the same offer three ways: plain, playful and premium. Use it to settle a debate about tone by comparing finished copy side by side.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Input\" holds the offer, a reusable water bottle that stays cold all day. \"2 Agent\" writes three labelled versions of about 40 words each. \"3 Output\" shows them as text.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on the Agent and replace the offer in \"1 Input\" with your own product, or add a fourth register such as urgent to the system prompt."
